0..61 Comment "//! A fold that crosses the two words of a choice is refused."
62..65 Comment "//!"
66..144 Comment "//! A choice under the high bit is its first word. The check reads the call of"
145..222 Comment "//! a fold at a variable of the rule as one value. That reading must admit no"
223..281 Comment "//! fold that gives the two sides of the rule two answers."
282..285 Comment "//!"
286..365 Comment "//! A fold that crosses the two words of a choice gives the value of the second"
366..445 Comment "//! word for the first. A fold with a parameter after the term gives a function"
446..505 Comment "//! for each term and no value, so its call stays as it is."
506..509 Comment "//!"
510..526 Comment "//! - see: #8367"
527..608 Comment "//! - see: `model/desc/fold-drops-variable.gandr` — the fold that respects each"
609..619 Comment "//!   rule"
621..647 Comment "// `Width` and `Fragment`."
